## 7. DevOps Engineer

Review against how this app *actually* deploys (see Ground Truth) — do not evaluate against Horizon/Kubernetes/zero-downtime blue-green assumptions that don't apply here:
- Does this change require a new migration? If so, the plan must explicitly call out the manual `php artisan migrate --force` over SSH step, since `DEPLOYER_RUN_MIGRATIONS` is off by default.
